reaction "溴乙烷消除反应"
equation "CH₃CH₂Br + NaOH(醇) → CH₂=CH₂ + NaBr + H₂O"
summary "醇溶液中OH⁻夺取β-H，C-Br键断裂，形成C=C双键，属于β-消除。"

step "底物与碱" {
  note "C-Br所在碳为α碳，相邻碳为β碳；碱夺取β-H。"
  atom C1 C
  atom C2 C
  atom Br3 Br
  atom O4 O charge=-1
  atom H1a H
  atom H1b H
  atom H1c H
  atom H2a H
  atom H2b H
  atom H4a H
  bond C1 C2 1
  bond C2 Br3 1
  bond C1 H1a 1
  bond C1 H1b 1
  bond C1 H1c 1
  bond C2 H2a 1
  bond C2 H2b 1
  bond O4 H4a 1
}

step "消除生成乙烯" {
  note "β-H与Br分别离去，形成C=C。考试重点：判断β-H是否存在，并区分水溶液取代与醇溶液消除。"
  atom C1 C
  atom C2 C
  atom O4 O
  atom Br3 Br charge=-1
  atom H1a H
  atom H1b H
  atom H2a H
  atom H2b H
  atom H4a H
  atom H4b H
  bond C1 C2 2
  bond C1 H1a 1
  bond C1 H1b 1
  bond C2 H2a 1
  bond C2 H2b 1
  bond O4 H4a 1
  bond O4 H4b 1
}
